```javascript
function promptUser() {
    let input = window.prompt("Please enter some text:");
    console.log(input);
}

promptUser();
```

In this example, `window.prompt()` is used to display a dialog box where the user can enter text. The entered text is then stored in the `input` variable and logged to the console for demonstration.

